#: src/extensions/installing-extensions.md:3
msgid "Installing Extensions"
msgstr "安裝擴充功能"

#: src/extensions/installing-extensions.md:5
msgid ""
"Extensions add functionality to Zed, including languages, themes, and AI "
"tools. Browse and install them from the Extension Gallery."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/installing-extensions.md:7
msgid ""
"Open the Extension Gallery with <kbd class=\"keybinding\">cmd-shift-x\\|ctrl-"
"shift-x</kbd>, or select \"Zed > Extensions\" from the menu bar."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/installing-extensions.md:9
msgid "Installation Location"
msgstr "安裝位置"

#: src/extensions/installing-extensions.md:11
msgid ""
"On macOS, extensions are installed in `~/Library/Application Support/Zed/"
"extensions`."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/installing-extensions.md:12
msgid ""
"On Linux, they are installed in either `$XDG_DATA_HOME/zed/extensions` or "
"`~/.local/share/zed/extensions`."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/installing-extensions.md:13
msgid "On Windows, the directory is `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Zed\\extensions`."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/installing-extensions.md:15
msgid "This directory contains two subdirectories:"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/installing-extensions.md:17
msgid "`installed`, which contains the source code for each extension."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/installing-extensions.md:18
msgid ""
"`work` which contains files created by the extension itself, such as "
"downloaded language servers."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/installing-extensions.md:20
msgid "Auto-installing"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/installing-extensions.md:22
msgid ""
"To automate extension installation/uninstallation see the docs for "
"[auto_install_extensions](../reference/all-settings.md#auto-install-"
"extensions)."
msgstr ""
